  "notes": "{安売|やすう}り combines {安|やす}い (cheap) with {売|う}り (selling), meaning to sell at reduced prices.\n\nCommon expressions:\n- {安売|やすう}りする (to sell at a discount)\n- {安売|やすう}り{中|ちゅう} (currently on sale)\n- {安売|やすう}り{店|てん} (discount store)\n\nFigurative usage:\n- {自分|じぶん}を{安売|やすう}りする (to sell oneself short, to undervalue oneself)\n\nRelated terms:\n- セール (sale)\n- {特売|とくばい} (special sale)\n- バーゲン (bargain sale)",
